        "heading": "BORN TO REDEFINE ON-THE-GO PERFORMANCE",
        "description": "<p>Using his chemistry background, he was inspired to revolutionize sugar-free gum by offering convenient performance solutions for people on the move.</p><p>After a Type-1 diabetes diagnosis, founder Blake cut out all the unnecessary sugar and cr*p from his diet.</p>",
