        "text": "<ul><li>Studied & Effective Ingredients</li><li>Made with strict quality standards</li><li>Tested for safety and purity</li><li>Zero Sugar, Zero Downsides</li><li>vegan-friendly and gluten-free</li><li>proudly based in Austin, Texas</li></ul>"
      }
    },
    "faq_pP4iGQ": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_pyfcwh": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "1.  What makes Chew Rev different from regular gum?",
            "content": "<p>Chew Rev isn’t just gum—it’s fuel. Each piece is packed with caffeine, electrolytes, and functional ingredients to help boost energy, focus, and hydration. No sugar. No crash.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_FigBRt": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "2. How much caffeine is in each piece?",
            "content": "<p>It depends on where you are. Orders processed here will take 5-7 business days to arrive. Overseas deliveries can take anywhere from 7-16 days. Delivery details will be provided in your confirmation email.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_g93AL6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "3.  When should I chew it?",
            "content": "<p>You can contact us through our contact page! We will be happy to assist you.</p>"
